      <activity id="ebbd5336-bb02-57cb-8238-8cc655f59323" activityNameId="7febff69-7d5c-5277-95f2-ec8036acb3aa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Vinyl chloride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Vinyl chloride, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=99a93e93-a8a8-34f3-88f3-6af0c21c4762
The VCM production  process, upstream processes like ethylene and chlorine production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The VCM production process, upstream processes like ethylene and chlorine production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2013 with the methane emission updates in 2023.
Production volume: referring to covered VCM nameplate capacity (71 % of 5.275 kt in 2013)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by ECVM member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_99a93e93-a8a8-34f3-88f3-6af0c21c4762.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
